# The claim-head guard dropped: an activation arms without replaying to the head
# its claim returned, so it passes another activation's appends below it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestNoClaimHeadReplay
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms without replaying to its claim head
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
Armed(a) ==
    /\ rp[a] >= claimHead[a] - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no replay to the claim head.
Armed(a) ==
--- END